# === Copyrighted game ROMs / assets — NEVER commit or distribute ===
# SM64 base ROM (asset source for the port) and any N64 ROM: copyright, DMCA-grey.
# Kept local / build-time only, like the DOOM WAD. See memory nyxos-sm64-port-plan.
*.z64
*.n64
*.v64
baserom*.z64

