# === Root-level render / test artifacts ===
# The repository root holds ONLY source, build scripts and metadata. Loose images,
# raw renders and scratch disk images belong in media/, docs/ or scratchpad/ — these
# anchored (leading-slash) patterns keep ad-hoc screendump/wallgen output out of root
# without touching the real assets committed under media/ and docs/.
/*.ppm
/*.img
/audit_*.png
/btn*.png
/desk*.png
/night*.png
/nf*.png
/devnull

# === Scratchpad (session temp files: build logs, patches, screendumps) ===
scratchpad/

# Local-only detailed changelog (kept out of the public repo)
AGENTS.md

